[N 20-21 Ruins of Lordaeron]
[D Forever Druid 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Level-20 errands in Stormwind, the Windborne Cat Spirit quests in Darnassus and Moonglade (Cat Form), the boats from Rut'theran to Auberdine and on to Southshore, the trek to the Ruins of Lordaeron (Forever's new 16-22 dungeon above the Undercity, 4 Alliance quests all picked up inside) and the hand-ins back home.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 20|r  -  you are in Cathedral Square with the Deadmines done; hearth = Sentinel Hill. This chapter is a dungeon trip: ~10,900 quest XP plus a full clear of 18-22 mobs, and the best 20-22 gear on the route. Do it now - the mobs go grey at 26.
[OC]|cffffcc00Why RoL first:|r the four Alliance quests are picked up INSIDE the instance (nothing to fetch beforehand) and hand in back in Stormwind. The dungeon sits in Tirisfal Glades, so the trip is boats + a run through Horde country; the hearth brings you straight back.
[O]Journeyman Skinning/Mining if you did not get it at 17 (needs skill 50; most people are past 50 by now): [TAR5513 Gelman Stonehand] teaches Mining here in the Dwarven District and [TAR1292 Maris Granger] teaches Skinning in Old Town (72.1,62.2) [G59.2,37.8 Stormwind City]
At [TAR1719 Warden Thelwater] outside the Stockade, [QT389] - he offers The Stockade Riots now; leave it, the Stockade is chapter 15 [G51.5,69.4 Stormwind City]
In the Park at [TAR4984 Argos Nightwhisper], [QA3765 The Corruption Abroad] (1,450 XP for talking to his brother in Auberdine, which the boat passes - it also opens the Blackfathom quest) [G36.2,67.6 Stormwind City]
[OC]Stock 20 food and 20 water (vendors in the Trade District), repair, empty your bags - the Ruins drop a lot of green loot
[OC]|cffffffffWindborne Cat Spirit: Darnassus and Moonglade|r  -  5 hand-ins, 2,885 XP (The Great Cat Spirit 390 + The Great Windborne Cat Spirit 780 + 780 + Blessings of the Great Windborne Cat Spirit 780 + To Darnassus 155); it teaches Cat Form. No hearth: the loop ends on the Rut'theran boat to Auberdine, where this trip goes anyway
[OC]Cast Teleport: Moonglade from the Park; you arrive in Nighthaven
At [TAR11800 Silva Fil'naveth], take the free druid flight to Rut'theran Village, then walk into the portal in the village up to Darnassus [G44.2,45.2 Moonglade]
In the Cenarion Enclave at [TAR4217 Mathrengyl Bearwalker], [QA98393 The Great Cat Spirit] (needs level 20) [G35.4,8.4 Darnassus]
[OC]Cast Teleport: Moonglade
In Nighthaven at [TAR11802 Dendrite Starblaze], [QT98393 The Great Cat Spirit] [QA98341 The Great Windborne Cat Spirit] [G56.2,30.6 Moonglade]
Run south past the twin bridges to the [TAR272054 Avatar of Saeyleenan], [QT98341 The Great Windborne Cat Spirit] [QA98404 The Great Windborne Cat Spirit] [G43.9,73.4 Moonglade]
[OC]The relics are in the Stormrage Barrow Dens east of the Avatar. Reported (not verified): a statue outside gives a 5-minute stealth buff, and the relics are party loot - invite anyone else on the quest
Loot the Relic of the Fang [QC98404,1] [G72.4,66 Moonglade]
Loot the Relic of the Silent Shadow [QC98404,3] [G74.4,65.4 Moonglade]
Loot the Relic of the Claw [QC98404,2] [G75.2,67.2 Moonglade]
Back at the [TAR272054 Avatar of Saeyleenan], [QT98404 The Great Windborne Cat Spirit] [QA98738 Blessings of the Great Windborne Cat Spirit] [G43.9,73.4 Moonglade]
[OC]Cast Teleport: Moonglade - quicker than the run north
In Nighthaven at [TAR11802 Dendrite Starblaze], [QT98738 Blessings of the Great Windborne Cat Spirit] [QA98397 To Darnassus] [G56.2,30.6 Moonglade]
At [TAR11800 Silva Fil'naveth], fly to Rut'theran Village and take the portal up to Darnassus [G44.2,45.2 Moonglade]
In the Cenarion Enclave at [TAR4217 Mathrengyl Bearwalker], [QT98397 To Darnassus] - it teaches Cat Form (Wowhead) - and [T] train (level 20: Claw, Shred, Rip, Prowl, Starfire, Rebirth; Cat Form too if the quest did not teach it - unverified) [G35.4,8.4 Darnassus]
[OC]|cffffcc00Cat Form from here:|r Prowl up to the target, open with Shred from behind (Claw from the front), build combo points and finish with Rip; you are melee dps in Cat Form from now on, Bear Form is for emergencies (Classic reasoning, unverified on Forever)
Take the portal back down to Rut'theran Village (the Darnassus end of the portal is unverified on Forever) and board the boat to Auberdine at the pier (about 5 minutes) [G58.4,94 Teldrassil]
[OC]|cffffffffThe way north|r  -  the Rut'theran boat to Auberdine, then the Auberdine boat to Menethil Harbor, and in Forever that same boat carries on to |cff66ff66Southshore|r in Hillsbrad. Stay aboard at Menethil.
Off the Rut'theran boat in Auberdine, on the dock at [TAR8997 Gershala Nightwhisper], [QT3765] [QA1275 Researching the Corruption] (8 Corrupted Brain Stems from the Fallenroot satyrs in and around Blackfathom - chapter 13) [G38.3,43 Darkshore]
[O]At [TAR2913 Archaeologist Hollee] on the same dock, [QA98461 Unrequited Love] (165 XP breadcrumb to Menethil - hand in whenever you are there) [G37.4,41.8 Darkshore]
Cross the dock and take the Menethil boat; stay on it through Menethil until it docks at Southshore [G33.5,40 Darkshore]
At Southshore get the [P] flight path (you will fly back here for the Hillsbrad quests at 29-30) [G49.4,52.4 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[OC]|cFFFF0000The trek (15-20 min at 20):|r north out of Southshore, keep WEST of the road - Tarren Mill (Horde town, 55+ guards) is in the north-east; cross the Hillsbrad Fields (level 20-24 farmers and Syndicate), then the pass in the north-west corner into Alterac and down into the Dalaran crater (22-24 Kirin Tor mages, avoidable). Dalaran sits on the west shore of Lordamere Lake.
Run to the Hillsbrad Fields [G33,42 Hillsbrad Foothills]
Through the north-west pass to Dalaran [G18,72 Alterac Mountains]
[OC]Swim from the Dalaran shore north across Lordamere Lake until the zone text says Tirisfal Glades. The ruined city on the shore ahead is the Ruins of Lordaeron; the instance portal is in the courtyard past the broken gates (Undercity's Deathguards patrol the courtyard - a death here is cheap: the spirit healer stands right outside the portal, so release and ghost in)
Swim to the Ruins of Lordaeron courtyard and enter the instance [G61,67 Tirisfal Glades]

[OC]|cffffffffRuins of Lordaeron|r  -  group of 5, finder level 15, bosses 18-22, ~45 min. All four quests come from inside:
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Abominable Creatures (95250) - the Baron's head - |cff66ff66normal|r, from Captain Truman at the entrance
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Bloodied Insignia (95195) - 10 insignias from the undead - |cff66ff66normal|r, the first one you loot starts the quest; the skeletons/cadavers/ghouls drop them all run long, everyone loots their own
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Crest of Lordaeron (95189) - |cff66ff66normal|r, a clickable crest lying on the ground (several possible spots along the route - look for the glinting shield); click it to start, hand in to Lady Dena Kennedy in Stormwind
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Remember That I Love You (92415) - |cff66ff66normal|r, a Blood-Stained Parchment lying next to the last boss, Rath'mael; click it to start, hand in to the orphan matron in Stormwind
At [TAR265701 Captain Truman] just inside, [QA95250 Abominable Creatures]
[O]Loot a Bloodied Insignia from the first undead you kill and right-click it [QA95195 Bloodied Insignia], then keep looting [QC95195]
[O]Click the Crest of Lordaeron when you see it lying along the route [QA95189 Crest of Lordaeron]
[OC]|cffffcc00Cat Form for the run:|r find a tank and a healer; you are melee dps. Let the tank pull, Prowl in behind the kill target, Shred/Claw to 4-5 combo points and Rip; never open on a fresh pack. Shift to Bear Form and Growl if the tank dies. Flesh Golems: back to a wall so Knock Away cannot throw you into a pack (Classic reasoning, unverified on Forever)
[OC]|cffffffffThe run|r  -  spider wing first: Venom Lurkers / Spiders / Tarantulas in patrolling packs - pull them back to you, do not fight next to a second pack. |cffffcc00Witherfang|r (patrols King's Alley) comes with two spiders: kill those first; Leech Poison on the tank - Cure Poison it (shift out of Cat Form; learned at 14), otherwise heal and bandage through it.
[OC][A Druid] |cffffcc00Loot (Witherfang):|r roll on |cff66ff66Segmented Spider Leg|r (staff 17.5 dps +9 Agi +5 Spi, 31.42% drop); |cff66ff66Witherbite Bracers|r (leather wrist +4 Agi, 28.87% drop)
[OC]|cffffcc00The Baron|r: Knockout = a big hit plus a threat drop; the tank stays at full health going in, everyone stops DPS for two seconds after each Knockout. Loot the Head [QC95250] - one kill only: Wowhead Forever lists the Head at ~15%, which is probably non-quest-holders skewing the count, but if it does not drop, do NOT re-run for it; abandon the quest on the way out
[OC][A Druid] |cffffcc00Loot (The Baron):|r roll on |cff66ff66Meathook Slicer|r (dagger 13.6 dps +5 Sta, 30.41% drop); |cff66ff66Leftover Abomination Skin|r (cloth chest +9 Spi, 31.42% drop)
[OC]|cffffcc00Viktor the Vile|r (optional boss): light the chimney fire in the south-west building of Lordamere Overlook by the graveyard - 5 waves of adds, then Viktor (Leech Poison, hard melee). Let the tank pick each wave up first.
[OC][A Druid] |cffffcc00Loot (Viktor the Vile):|r roll on |cff66ff66Bloodied Chestwraps|r (leather chest +7 Agi +9 Spi, 33.01% drop)
[OC]Flesh Golems patrol the Overlook: Knock Away throws the tank into other packs - pull them to open ground. Ghoul packs of 3-4 hit hard: one pack at a time.
[OC]|cffffcc00The Abandoned|r (Market Street statue event): 3 waves, then the boss - Frost Nova, Life Drain on the tank, a chill on anyone who melees him. Skeletal Soldier packs and Shrieking Banshees (silence) guard the street - stuns are your friend.
[OC][A Druid] |cffffcc00Loot (The Abandoned):|r roll on |cff66ff66Scepter of the Abandoned|r (1H mace 9.6 dps, 33.65% drop); |cff66ff66Rotmender's Leggings|r (cloth legs +5 Sta, 34.45% drop)
[OC]|cffffcc00Bjork|r: a short Anti-Magic Shield, otherwise tank and spank. |cffffcc00Rath'mael|r (last): Flamestrike lands where the tank stood when the cast began - everyone steps out of the fire; whoever has an interrupt uses it on the cast.
[OC][A Druid] |cffffcc00Loot (Bjork):|r roll on |cff66ff66Tuskwrap Belt|r (cloth waist +5 Spi, 33.59% drop)
[OC][A Druid] |cffffcc00Loot (Rath'mael):|r roll on |cff66ff66Coldspire Staff|r (staff 15.1 dps, 32.72% drop); |cff66ff66Rotmender's Treads|r (cloth feet +7 Sta, 30.09% drop)
Click the Blood-Stained Parchment lying beside Rath'mael's platform [QA92415 Remember That I Love You]
Hand in to [TAR265701 Captain Truman] at the entrance on the way out [QT95250]
[OC][A Druid] |cffffcc00Gear:|r take |cff66ff66Grave Shroud|r (cloak +3 Str +3 Sta)
