In Cathedral Square at [TAR14450 Orphan Matron Nightingale], [QT92415] [QA95161 Remember That I Love You] (deliver the letter to Avette Fellwood in Darkshire - chapter 14; the Tarnished Locket is a 175-XP neck with -3 Str, vendor it) [G56.3,54 Stormwind City]
